  "notes": "Near-black monochrome dark theme (#181818 page, #202020 filled cards with 12px radius, #313131 selected nav) with colour reserved almost exclusively for run status: green/red bars in tiny per-card run-history strips, lime 'Successful' text, coral 'Failed'. Cards group by status with count pills ('Active 5', 'Inactive 2'). Each card is dense: title + play + ⋮, truncated description, repo/trigger/tag chips with '+N' overflow, a bordered latest-run row (icon + state + live message + relative time), and a three-column Runs/Recent success/Avg. duration definition list. Two-level navigation: global sidebar with conversation recents (status checkmarks/dots, small 'Project:' tag chips) and an Automate sub-nav column. Ctrl+K command palette is a centered overlay with sectioned rows (icon tile, name, description, 'GO' key hint)."
